    "text": "If <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math>, then the value of <math><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt></math> is equal to",
