  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Adding both the given equations, we get,</p><p><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Similarly, <math><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
